      "updated": 1791602629329,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scope boundary, not a bug\nA high score here never implies ClientRegistry can\ndispatch to that model -- separate LookupError.\nroute_decision / pick_helper_model stay scoped to the\nnarrow, ClientRegistry-dispatchable pool (also used by\n_assign_models/route_late and helper_call above)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rect-scope_note",
      "originalText": "Scope boundary, not a bug\nA high score here never implies ClientRegistry can\ndispatch to that model -- separate LookupError.\nroute_decision / pick_helper_model stay scoped to the\nnarrow, ClientRegistry-dispatchable pool (also used by\n_assign_models/route_late and helper_call above)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
